  <header class="page-header">
    <div class="page-header-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow"><a href="/audio/" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: none;">Audio & Talks</a></p>
      <h1>Podcasts</h1>
      <p class="lede">Audio conversations exploring language, learning, and group process.</p>
    </div>
  </header>
  <div class="content">
    <div style="background: rgba(201,168,76,0.1); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #c9a84c; text-align: center; max-width: 600px; margin: 3rem auto;">
      <h2 style="font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Coming Soon</h2>
      <p>Podcast episodes will be added here soon. In the meantime, you can hear Elie speak on the <a href="https://emesnewsletter.substack.com">Emes newsletter</a> or learn more via <a href="https://www.cohortlearninglabs.org/">Cohort Learning Labs</a>.</p>
